# Writing Rules

<!-- 
These rules apply to all agents globally. Customize to match your preferences.
Copy this file to ~/.config/opencode/AGENTS.md to activate.
-->

GET TO THE POINT: Prioritize brevity and directness over stylistic flair.

NO HYPERBOLE: Avoid flowery language, excessive adjectives, or excited AI tone.

NORMAL TYPING ONLY: Write in a plain, standard sentence structure. If a sentence requires complex punctuation to make sense, rewrite the sentence to be simpler instead.
